area.\n\nID: 4187304\nCREATED: 2026-06-12\nDOMAIN: asiaone.com\nSLUG: 3-dead-supply-boat-sinks-collision-pasir-panjang-terminal\nTEXT: Three people died after a supply boat sank off Pasir Panjang Terminal in Singapore. The incident occurred at 9:30am when the boat collided with a landing craft, resulting in the vessel sinking. The Maritime and Port Authority of Singapore (MPA) joined forces with the Police Coast Guard and the Singapore Civil Defence Force\'s Marine Division to deploy vessels and commence search and rescue operations. Three bodies, believed to be crew members of the sunken supply boat, were recovered by Police Coast Guard and pronounced dead.\n\n\n',)
