etadata field is not consistent, set it to null.\n   - Metadata keys:\n       - location\n       - subject_matter\n       - industry\n       - time  (represents WHEN the event occurred, not when published)\n\nReturn ONLY a JSON object with this structure:\n\n{\n  "subject": "...",\n  "predicate": "...",\n  "object": "...",\n  "metadata": {\n    "location": "... or null",\n    "subject_matter": "... or null",\n    "industry": "... or null",\n    "time": "... or null"\n  }\n}\n\nHere are the RawRecords:\n\nID: 4186918\nCREATED: 2026-06-12\nDOMAIN: prnewswire.com\nSLUG: hisense-feiert-den-beginn-zur-fifa-fuwball-weltmeisterschaft-2026-mit-einer-rgb-miniled-innovation-302799306-html\nTEXT: Hisense celebrates the start of the 2026 FIFA World Football Championship with an RGB MiniLED innovation. The company, founded in 1969, remains true to its mission "Innovating a Brighter Life" by developing technologies that not only function brilliantly but also enrich the moments that truly matter. Hisense is a leading global company in household appliances and entertainment electronics with activities in over 160 countries. The company is specialized in high-quality multimediaproduces, household appliances and intelligent IT solutions. Hisense is the world number 1 in the TV segment with a size of 100 inches and more (2023-2026Q1). The company is further leading in the RGB MiniLED innovation of the next generation.\n\nID: 4186917\nCREATED: 2026-06-12\nDOMAIN: prnewswire.com\nSLUG: hisense-celebre-le-coup-denvoi-de-la-coupe-du-monde-de-la-fifa-2026-avec-une-innovation-en-matiere-de-rgb-miniled-302799300-html\nTEXT: Hisense\'s RGB MiniLED technology is set to revolutionize the football world with its latest innovation. The company, known for its exceptional performance and immersive experiences, is partnering with the FIFA 2026 World Cup to showcase its technology on a global stage. As a leader in the electronics industry, Hisense has been recognized for its innovative products, including its RGB MiniLED technology, which offers unparalleled brightness and color accuracy. With its commitment to "Innovating a Brighter Life," Hisense aims to enrich the moments that matter most, and its partnership with the FIFA 2026 World Cup is a prime example of this.\n\nID: 4186916\nCREATED: 2026-06-12\nDOMAIN: prnewswire.com\nSLUG: hisense-celebra-el-inicio-de-la-copa-mundial-de-la-fifa-2026-con-la-innovadora-tecnologia-rgb-miniled-302799314-html\nTEXT: Hisense celebrates the start of the 2026 FIFA World Cup with its innovative RGB MiniLED technology. The company, which has been a leader in home electronics since 1969, is committed to its mission of "Innovating for a brighter life" by creating technology that not only shines bright but also enriches the most important moments. As a pioneer of RGB MiniLED, Hisense continues to lead innovation in the next generation of this technology. As an official sponsor of the 2026 FIFA World Cup, Hisense is committed to global sports partnerships as a way to connect with fans worldwide.\n\n\n',)
